OL,3,GNEWSAMan who studied drama in young    
OL,4,Aoffenders' institution now a West End  
OL,5,Aactor                                  
OL,7,FA former young offender who became a   
OL,8,FWest End actor says taking drama       
OL,9,Flessons while he was detained was the  
OL,10,Fbest decision he ever made.            
OL,12,FJoseph Langdon, who grew up in south   
OL,13,FLondon, was convicted of gang-related  
OL,14,Fcrimes at the the age of 16. But while 
OL,15,Fin a young offenders' institution, he  
OL,16,Fwas offered drama lessons through a    
OL,17,Fscheme with the Bristol Old Vic.       
OL,19,FLangdon said the lessons taught him    
OL,20,F"that I could make something of my     
OL,21,Flife, and introduced me to this world I
OL,22,Fdid not think was possible".           
