OL,3,GNEWSAMan who studied drama in young    
OL,4,Aoffenders' institution now a West End  
OL,5,Aactor                                  
OL,7,FThe actor, who will play the prince in 
OL,8,Fthe theatre's Christmas production of  
OL,9,FCinderella: A Fairytale, said: "I count
OL,10,Fmy blessings every day. I turn up to   
OL,11,Frehearsals with a huge smile on my     
OL,12,Fface."                                 
